WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:22.985 --> 00:00:24.885
 

00:00:24.885 --> 00:00:27.700
What did you do this weekend, Diana?

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:29.080
Me?  Mmhm.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:30.440
Nothing very interesting.

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:30.940
 

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:31.440
 

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:36.800
The world remains in mourning after the death of the Superman.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:38.175
 

00:00:38.175 --> 00:00:41.155
 

00:00:41.155 --> 00:00:44.235
 

00:00:44.235 --> 00:00:45.235
 

00:00:45.235 --> 00:00:45.835
 

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:48.020
They said the age of heroes would never come again.

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:49.300
It has to.

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:58.480
We don't have anymore time.

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:00.680
 

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:02.620
Something is coming.

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:18.300
No Protectors here!

00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:26.900
No Lanterns

00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:33.120
No Kryptonian

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:38.680
This World Will Fall

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:42.380
 

00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:45.440
Like all the others.

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:50.840
One misses the days when one's biggest concerns were exploding wind-up penguins...

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:54.915
This is crazy.

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:56.980
Honestly, I think we're all gonna die.

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:05.880
Each of us, in some way, has held back.

00:02:06.780 --> 00:02:08.375
Don't engage alone.

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:10.140
We do this together.

00:02:10.700 --> 00:02:11.200
 

00:02:11.205 --> 00:02:14.740
It's really cool that you guys seem ready to do battle and stuff, but I've never done battle.

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:17.980
I've just pushed some people and run away...

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:23.160
 

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:26.715
 

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:28.980
Relax, Alfred. I'll take it from here.

00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:29.480
 

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:31.000
Uh. D-Do I know you?

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:31.680
 

00:02:36.020 --> 00:02:38.360
Superman was a Beacon to the world.

00:02:38.580 --> 00:02:39.080
 

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:44.280
He didn't just save people, he made them see the best parts of themselves.

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:44.780
 

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:48.180
All right.

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:49.540
I don't recognize this world.

00:02:50.620 --> 00:02:53.040
You don't have to recognize it.

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:59.000
You just have to save it.

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:08.100
Woo Hoo!

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:16.380
How many of you are there?

00:03:16.740 --> 00:03:17.740
Not enough.

00:03:17.740 --> 00:03:18.600
Do you really think that...

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:24.620
Oh wow. They just...they really just vanished.

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:25.800
Huh? Oh...That's rude.

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:27.400
 

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:48.920
They said you'd come.

00:03:49.960 --> 00:03:53.080
Now, let's hope you're not too late.

